    <textTemplates>
        <name>EmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SSN Mismatch Client Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SSN Mismatch / {!varSubClient.NSP_Client__c} / {!varCase.Contact.NSP_Per_ID__c}{!varCase.Contact.Workday_Employee_ID__c} / {!varCase.Contact.FirstName} {!varCase.Contact.LastName}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ISSUE: The Social Security Administration (SSA) has informed Insperity that there is a mismatch with the Social Security records (name, Social Security Number (SSN), and/or date of birth) submitted by this employee.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The mismatch code is listed as {!varCase.SSNVS_Mismatch__c}.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedure for Resolving Your SSN Mismatch:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Verify with your employee that the name, date of birth, and SSN we have on file for the employee matches our records.&amp;nbsp;If the name, date of birth, or SSN we have on file for your employee is NOT correct:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complete a Change of Personal Information Form and send it to your Payroll Specialist securely via Premier File Share.&amp;nbsp;If you use Insperity Workday, then please submit a Change Request in Workday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the name, date of birth, and SSN we have on file matches what was entered for the employee:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Your employee can contact a Social Security Administration (SSA) field office to resolve the mismatch.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 7pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Inform SSA that you are there because there is a mismatch in your SSN record.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;To locate an SSA field office, you may visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.socialsecurity.gov/locator&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.socialsecurity.gov/locator&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or call SSA at 800-772-1213 (TTY: 800-325-0778).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Insperity will verify any change in information with SSA prior to updating the Company’s records.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This employee will receive an SSN Mismatch letter notifying them of the mismatch along with instructions for resolution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For more information regarding the Social Security Number Verification Service, visit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ssa.gov/employer/ssnv.htm&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.ssa.gov/employer/ssnv.htm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:SSNVS@insperity.com&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;SSNVS@insperity.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Social Security Number Verification Team&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
